WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.200
MOVE + FIRE   ·   Sweep the cannon across the bottom

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.120
HIT   ·   One life lost

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:12.400
RESPAWN   ·   Back in the fight, with brief protection

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.650
R   RAPID FIRE   ·   Twice the firing rate

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:18.400
B   PULSE SUPPLY   ·   An extra defensive pulse

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:23.950
R   RAPID FIRE   ·   Collect another capsule to recharge

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:28.150
S   SHIELD   ·   Protection against the next hit

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:31.100
+   REPAIR   ·   One life restored

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:37.000
3   TRIPLE SHOT   ·   Three lanes of fire

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:45.750
KEEP MOVING   ·   Clear the last diving attackers

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:48.000
SECTOR SECURED   ·   Level 58 complete
